A '''smooth sandstone slab''' is a decorative [[slab]] variant of [[smooth sandstone]] that generates in [[desert village]]s and is used for building.

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
Smooth sandstone slabs can be mined using any [[pickaxe]]. If mined without a pickaxe, they drop nothing.

{{breaking row
|Smooth Sandstone Slab
|Pickaxe
|Wooden
|item=1
|link=none
|horizontal=1
}}

=== Natural generation ===
Smooth sandstone slabs generate as part of [[desert village]]s.

